      "label": "Survey board",
      "mapLabel": "Survey board",
      "lines": [
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "amber-ridge.seal"
          },
          "text": "SURVEY BOARD. Spring Pond \u00b7 Survey Bridge south \u00b7 Lookout east. Rumour: travellers back from the red ridge say the badlands shrine is calm again."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "visited": "amber-ridge"
          },
          "text": "SURVEY BOARD. Spring Pond \u00b7 Survey Bridge south \u00b7 Lookout east. Rumour: dry-country friends are bold near the ridge shrine. Bring rested companions."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "visited": "orchard-ruins"
          },
          "text": "SURVEY BOARD. Spring Pond \u00b7 Survey Bridge south \u00b7 Lookout east. Rumour: the old orchard keeps its water tidy; someone has been reading the sluice marks."
        },
        {
          "text": "SURVEY BOARD. Spring Pond \u00b7 Survey Bridge south \u00b7 Lookout east. Rumour: the meadow trail runs north; the Warden keeps the way home lit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "spring-stone",
      "kind": "sign",
      "sprite": "prop-well-ruined",
      "at": [28.0, 25.0],
      "w": 46,
      "label": "Spring stone",
      "mapLabel": "The spring",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The spring rises here and runs through the commons pond, then south under the survey bridge. Everything in town drinks from it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "commons-press",
      "kind": "sign",
      "sprite": "prop-cider-press",
      "at": [46.0, 13.8],
      "w": 64,
      "solid": 0.7,
      "label": "Commons cider press",
      "mapLabel": "Commons press",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The commons cider press. The apples are shared out evenly after the pressing, and the long bench beside it is for resting between turns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wren",
      "kind": "sign",
      "sprite": "person-traveler",
      "at": [43.0, 18.2],
      "w": 37,
      "name": "Wren the potter",
      "tag": "WREN",
      "label": "Wren the potter",
      "mapLabel": "Press green",
      "lines": [
        {
          "when": {
            "active": "fernling"
          },
          "text": "Is that a Fernling walking at your heel? Mine stands among the pots by the hour. It mistakes my pots for a garden."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "active": "emberkin"
          },
          "text": "An Emberkin! Keep it off the kiln shelf. It keeps trying to help."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "active": "brooklet"
          },
          "text": "A Brooklet is a fine friend for a potter. Wet clay never frightened it."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "active": "duskwing"
          },
          "text": "A Duskwing is welcome on the press frame. We hang a nest box for each that visits."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "party": "voltkit"
          },
          "text": "A Voltkit in your party? Keep it away from my kiln wire; it hums at it."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "caught": 6
          },
          "text": "So many friends in tow! The green is open to all of them. Sit, share the bench, tell me which one is the troublemaker."
        },
        {
          "text": "Welcome to the press green. Sit anywhere. The benches are for everyone, and so are the stories."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tobin",
      "kind": "sign",
      "sprite": "person-gardener",
      "at": [23.5, 37.4],
      "w": 37,
      "name": "Tobin",
      "tag": "TOBIN",
      "label": "Tobin, garden helper",
      "mapLabel": "Habitat garden",
      "lines": [
        {
          "when": {
            "party": "bramblebuck"
          },
          "text": "Your Bramblebuck is shaking its antlers at the garden gate! The wild ones in the straw are shy. Let it sniff first."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "party": "pebblit"
          },
          "text": "Is that a Pebblit with you? The wild ones sleep under the garden stones. Do not tell them yours can roll."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "caught": 3
          },
          "text": "You have a proper team! The garden is for resting, not fighting. Watch the little ones, say hello, then go on your way."
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the habitat garden. Nest boxes, a drinking trough and a warm wall: each friend likes a different corner. They are shy but never in a fight."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
